# Write Financial Guide Article

When the user says "撰写一篇长文指南文章" or similar, follow this automated workflow.

## Step 0: Read Plan & Pick Next Item

1. Read `.cursor/plans/guides.json`
2. Find the first item with `"status": "pending"`
3. Use that item's data (slug, title, targetKeyword, linkedCalculators) as the work target
4. Announce: "Working on guide: [title]"

## Step 1: Create Guide Page

Create `src/app/guides/[slug]/page.tsx`.

If `src/app/guides/` directory doesn't exist yet, create it with a layout or index page as well.

### Page structure:

```typescript
import type { Metadata } from "next";
import Image from "next/image";
