```

## Step 2: Write Content (1500-2500 words)

### Mandatory Structure

1. **TL;DR Box** — Quick answer in a styled callout box
2. **Infographic** — Generate with kie-image and embed
3. **Detailed Explanation** (400-600 words)
4. **Concrete Case Study** (300-400 words) — Named persona, real numbers
5. **Comparison Table** — HTML table with data
6. **Step-by-Step Actionable Guide** (200-300 words)
7. **Calculator CTA** — Link to relevant CalcWise calculator(s) from plan's `linkedCalculators`
8. **FAQ Section** (200-300 words) — 3-5 questions + JSON-LD schema

### TL;DR Box Format
```tsx
<div className="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-500 bg-brand-50 p-4 my-6">
  <p className="font-semibold text-ink-800">Quick Answer</p>
  <p className="mt-1 text-ink-700">[1-2 sentence direct answer to the title question]</p>
</div>
```

### Case Study Format
```
Example persona: "Jessica, a 28-year-old marketing manager earning $72,000 in Austin, TX..."
Include: specific salary, city, goal amount, timeline, monthly budget breakdown
Show: calculations using the relevant formula, final result
```

### Comparison Table Format
```tsx
<div className="overflow-x-auto my-6">
  <table className="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
    <thead>
      <tr className="border-b border-ink-200 bg-ink-50">
        <th className="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-ink-700">...</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr className="border-b border-ink-100">...</tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
```

### Infographic Generation

```bash
node ~/.cursor/skills/kie-image/generate.mjs "[clean minimal infographic, white background, relevant to the guide topic, include specific numbers/labels, blue and green color scheme, professional financial style, no decorative elements]" "3:2" --resolution 2K
```

Download to `public/images/guides/[slug].png`.

### Calculator CTA Format
```tsx
<div className="rounded-lg border border-brand-200 bg-brand-50 p-6 my-8 text-center">
  <p className="font-semibold text-ink-800">Run Your Own Numbers</p>
  <p className="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-600">Use our free calculator to see results for your situation.</p>
  <Link href="/calculators/[slug]" className="mt-3 inline-block rounded-lg bg-brand-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-brand-700">
    Open [Calculator Name] Calculator
  </Link>
</div>
```

## Step 3: Create Guides Index (if not exists)

If `src/app/guides/page.tsx` doesn't exist, create it as a listing of all guides.

## Step 4: Update Sitemap

Add guide pages to sitemap if not already auto-generating from a guides data file.

## Step 5: Verify Build

```bash
npm run build
```

## Step 6: Commit & Push

```bash
git add -A && git commit -m "Add guide: [title]" && git push
```

## Step 7: Update Plan Progress

Update `.cursor/plans/guides.json`: change the item's status from `"pending"` to `"done"` and add `"completedAt": "[ISO date]"`.

## Content Quality Rules

- NO emoji anywhere
- NO generic filler — every paragraph has specific numbers
- Target keyword should appear naturally in H1, first paragraph, and 2-3 subheadings
- All dollar amounts use US formatting
- Internal links to CalcWise calculators use relative paths
- External claims should cite specific sources where possible
